APPEND ~KKNavJ~

IF ~Global("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",1)~ THEN KKBT1
SAY ~That was certainly good news, I was afraid they had left the area again.~
++ ~Who was that person?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKBT1a
++ ~I think now would be a good time to explain this mission of yours.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKBT1i
+ ~Gender(Player1,MALE)~ + ~She was cute, friend of yours?~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKBT1j
++ ~How can you be sure they haven't? Two days is enough time to get far away from here if they got on a boat.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",2)~ + KKBT1k
++ ~I'm happy for you, let's go.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKBarbTalk","LOCALS",2)~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1a
SAY ~That was Shaelah.~ 
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1i
END

IF ~~ KKBT1i
SAY ~Shaelah and Tressa were sent to find three of our warriors who stole something from our Chieftain and fled Narfell.~
= ~After four tendays without word, our Chieftain sent me to search for them.~
++ ~Why send you if she already had people looking? She must realize it takes time to find people who don't want to be found.~ + KKBT1b
++ ~Was she afraid something happened to them, or was it that she does not trust them either?~ + KKBT1b
++ ~What did they steal?~ + KKBT1e
++ ~I am not sure that was a wise decision. At one against five, the odds are against you.~ + KKBT1c
++ ~Well, good luck with that.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1b
SAY ~She feared that something might have happened to them. The others could have discovered they were being followed and killed them.~
= ~I got the feeling that there was more to it than that but she refused to speak of it.~
++ ~Maybe because the other possibility is that the two she sent has joined forces with the three?~  + KKBT1c
++ ~What did they steal?~ + KKBT1e
++ ~She may have put your life in danger by sending you alone.~ + KKBT1h
++ ~If that is the case, why would she think they would not kill you?~ + KKBT1h
++ ~This should be interesting.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1c
SAY ~I do not believe that. Amana has turned her back on the tribe, she has been corrupted by Cyric. The two with her no doubt have also but, Shaelah and Tressa would not do such a thing.~
= ~They are faithful to our tribe and to Tempus.~
++ ~I hope you are right, but be on your guard. I agreed to help you whether it is three your up against or five.~ + KKBT1d
++ ~What did they steal?~ + KKBT1e
++ ~With Cyric involved, anything is possible. For your sake, I hope they are not your enemies.~ + KKBT1g
++ ~Let's catch up with the others.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1d
SAY ~I appreciate that. Three or five makes no difference, just completing my mission.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1e
END

IF ~~ KKBT1e
SAY ~Amana stole our Chieftain's sword. If anyone else had done that, the punishment is death. For one of our own to do such a thing, is unthinkable.~
++ ~A sword? All of this is over a sword?~ + KKBT1f
++ ~Even if I could understand why someone would kill another over a sword, you do not actually believe she will go back willingly do you?~ + KKBT1f
++ ~What is so special about this sword that your Chieftain would rather kill the thief than simply replace it?~ + KKBT1f
++ ~Forget I asked, I do not want to hear anymore.~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1f
SAY ~At a glance, it looks like any other two-handed sword used mostly by the Northern tribes, but this one is enchanted. It was forged by the barbarian gods during a great battle and dipped in the blood of the brave fallen.~ 
= ~Since then, it has been passed down from Chieftain to Chieftain because of the incredible power it possesses. It must be returned, even if Amana and the others have to die to accomplish it.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKBT1g
SAY ~I hope you are right, it would sadden me to have to kill them. But I will without question if they force my hand, my mission is that important.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1e
END

IF ~~ KKBT1h
SAY ~I do not believe our Chieftain would send me to my death. She knows I would seek aid if necessary and trusts my judgement.~ 
= ~I do see your point, I could very well be walking into a trap. Not that it matters, my mission is too important.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1e
END

IF ~~ KKBT1j
SAY ~That was Shaelah, and she would not hold the same opinion of you. To her you are nothing but a man and a potential slave, if she was in need of one.~ 
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1i
END

IF ~~ KKBT1k
SAY ~I cannot be sure of anything except the fact that they would never get on a boat. None of us would, not ever.~
= ~All I can do is hope they are tired of running and they are found. Now is a good time to fill you in so, I'll start with Shaelah.~
IF ~~ THEN + KKBT1i
END

IF ~Global("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",1)~ THEN KKW1
SAY ~If we could go to this pass Shaelah spoke of, I would be most grateful.~
++ ~Of course, we'll go there as soon as possible.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW1a
++ ~When we have the time, I can't worry about that right now.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW1b
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW1c
+ ~Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW1d
+ ~!Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNWarriors","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW1e
END

IF ~~ KKW1a
SAY ~Thank you, <CHARNAME>, It will be nice to have this mess over with.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW1b
SAY ~I understand, this must be very distressing for you.~
= ~But please try not to wait too long, I do not want them to run again.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW1c
SAY ~How could you do this to me? I cannot believe I was foolish enough to trust a man, much less give my heart to one!~ 
= ~You are a vile creature and I am glad to be rid of you!~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW1d
SAY ~How could you do this to me? I thought we were friends, but I see I was mistaken.~
= ~I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW1e
SAY ~Fine, I do not need your help. I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKWarriors2","LOCALS",1)~ THEN KKW2
SAY ~We need to go to Small Teeth Pass still, <CHARNAME>. Perhaps now would be a good time?~
++ ~Yes, of course. I'm sorry, I forgot about that. We'll go right now.~ + KKW2a
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors2","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW2b
+ ~Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors2","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW2c
+ ~!Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1) !Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I've changed my mind, I don't care about your problems and I'm not going to help you.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors2","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW2d
END

IF ~~ KKW2a
SAY ~Thank you. I hope they are still there and this can be over with soon.~
IF ~~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW2b
SAY ~How could you do this to me? I cannot believe I was foolish enough to trust a man, much less give my heart to one!~ 
= ~You are a vile creature and I am glad to be rid of you!~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW2c
SAY ~How could you do this to me? I thought we were friends, but I see I was mistaken.~
= ~I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW2d
SAY ~Fine, I do not need your help. I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~Global("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",1)~ THEN KKW3
SAY ~You lied to me <CHARNAME>! You should have told me you did not want to help me instead of misleading me.~
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I'm sorry, I forgot. We can go back after we help these people.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3a
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Excuse me for having more important things on my mind, like my soul!~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3a
+ ~Global("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~You're right, I should have told you. I don't want to help you and don't care about your problems.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3b
+ ~Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~I'm sorry, I forgot. We can go back after we help these people.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3c
+ ~Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~Excuse me for having more important things on my mind, like my soul!~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3c
+ ~Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1)~ + ~You're right, I should have told you. I don't want to help you and I don't care about your problems.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3d
+ ~!Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~I'm sorry, I forgot. We can go back after we help these people.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3e
+ ~!Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~Excuse me for having more important things on my mind, like my soul!~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3e
+ ~!Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",1) Global("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",2)~ + ~You're right, I should have told you. I don't want to help you and I don't care about your problems.~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKWarriors3","LOCALS",2)~ + KKW3f
END

IF ~~ KKW3a
SAY ~Enough of your excuses! I cannot believe I was foolish enough to trust a man, much less give my heart to one!~ 
= ~You are a vile creature and I am glad to be rid of you!~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW3b
SAY ~I should have known you would seek to use me for your own gain. I cannot believe I was foolish enough to trust a man, much less give my heart to one!~ 
= ~You are a vile creature and I am glad to be rid of you!~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarRomanceActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW3c
SAY ~Enough of your excuses! I thought we were friends, but I see I was mistaken.~
= ~I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW3d
SAY ~How could you do this to me? I thought we were friends, but I see I was mistaken.~
= ~I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~SetGlobal("KKNavarFriendActive","GLOBAL",3) LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW3e
SAY ~Enough of your excuses! I cannot believe I trusted you, I will not make that mistake again.~
= ~I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END

IF ~~ KKW3f
SAY ~Fine, I do not need your help. I can finish this on my own.~
IF ~~ DO ~LeaveParty() EscapeArea()~ EXIT
END
END